Hi Janet,

Attached are the annual renewal terms and the scope of services for your purc=
hasing review. The proposed term runs from May 1, 2025 through April 30, 2026=
, with a 480-seat contract limit and an annual amount of USD 232,000, includi=
ng the operating support in the scope. The terms are HBC-JDH-20250417-REN-01 =
and the support scope is HBC-JDH-20250417-SVC-01, both v1.0.

Could you please return JDH's purchasing confirmation by Friday, April 18 at =
5:00 p.m. Denver time? The offer is valid through that time. Please let me kn=
ow if purchasing has a question about either document before then.

The renewal sets the contract limit; it does not require every seat to be ass=
igned on May 1. Separately from the renewal agreement, we can work with Darre=
n and Divya on when each group is ready for assignment, including the roster,=
 responsible contact and practice slot. JDH will manage the rosters and assig=
nments, and our team will provide guidance and check readiness.

Thanks,
Michelle

